# INVWINEE.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: every row chosen
# at level 1 (READER), the 260 items of INVWIN_WINSEEDEE.  ADMIN first
# shows the audit log of the items, for its count.  READER's CTRL-/
# chooses all 260, as choosing changes nothing; DEL and CTRL-L then each
# show INV's refusal once, in one message box, with no question or form
# after it, and all stay chosen; the Record menu offers Select all and
# grays the commands that change records.  ADMIN again finds the 260
# items and their audit log as long as it was.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINEE.SNP is its snapshot; TEST/selchk.py checks
# it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-A A
T items
K ENTER
S AUDIT0
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER CTRL-SLASH
S ALL
K DEL
S NODEL
K ENTER
S NODELBK
K CTRL-L
S NOLEND
K ENTER ALT-C
S MENU
K ESC ESC ALT-F L STAB
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-A A
T items
K ENTER
S AUDIT1
K ALT-F X
